DTSTART:20260710T060000Z
DTEND:20260725T190000Z
SUMMARY:Build & Play Together
DESCRIPTION:A guided activity space where children take part in simple building tasks\, group play\, and short storytelling moments. The program introduces simple ideas about homes and daily life across cultures through hands-on participation.
LOCATION:Ithra - Children's Museum
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-build-play-together.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-echoes-of-the-familiar@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T060000Z
DTEND:20260930T200000Z
SUMMARY:Echoes of the Familiar
DESCRIPTION:Echoes of the Familiar exhibition explores the concept that home transcends mere physical space\, embodying a tapestry of memories intricately woven into its very walls. It is within these confines that the echoes of laughter from childhood games intermingle with the remnants of disagreements and tears shed upon pillows. Each drawer brims with knick-knacks whose purposes remain elusive yet evoke nostalgia. The scent of maternal cooking and the rhythmic snoring of a father create a comforting ambiance\, while the presence of a grandmother before the television grounds us in familial continuity. These shared experiences resonate universally\, forging a collective nostalgia for "al zaman al Jameel
LOCATION:Ithra - Museum - Gallery 2
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-echoes-of-the-familiar.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-tafasahu-make-room@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T060000Z
DTEND:20270320T190000Z
SUMMARY:Tafasahu: Make Room
DESCRIPTION:Tafasahu: Make Room is an exhibition that showcases a commissioned installation by Saudi architect and artist\, Nada AlMulla\, which invites you to enter as a guest&mdash\;to pause\, gather and reflect on the conditions of belonging within the context of the traditional Majlis\, Arabic for "gathering space." Beyond being a place to receive and host guests\, the Majlis has been a vessel for the transmission of knowledge and heritage. The installation deconstructs this space into its essential elements while centering stories\, memories and subtle traces of everyday life that animated it: conversations shared over coffee\, the lingering scent of incense\, the rhythms of gathering and departure. Hospita
LOCATION:Ithra - Museum - Gallery 0
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-tafasahu-make-room.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-leap-then-look@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T070000Z
DTEND:20260725T190000Z
SUMMARY:Leap Then Look!
DESCRIPTION:An intractive exhibition that encourages play and collabration\, Inviting visitors to assemble and combine different aculptures to create a collaborative artwork while exploring the senses and imagination.
LOCATION:Ithra - Children's Museum
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-leap-then-look.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-beaded-plant-suncatcher@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T093000Z
DTEND:20260711T113000Z
SUMMARY:Beaded plant Suncatcher
DESCRIPTION:Sunlight has a way of bringing a space to life. As it passes through a window\, it fills a room with color\, movement\, and small moments that make a house feel like home. In this workshop\, participants create beaded plant sun catchers inspired by the light that streams through our windows and the natural elements we welcome into our homes. By combining colorful beads and delicate forms\, each piece is designed to catch and reflect sunlight\, creating shifting patterns of color and light. The result is a decorative artwork that celebrates the warmth of home through nature\, color\, and light.
LOCATION:Ithra - Ithra Tower - Level 9\, Room 2
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-beaded-plant-suncatcher.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-puppet-world@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T113000Z
DTEND:20260711T190000Z
SUMMARY:Puppet World
DESCRIPTION:Step into Puppet World\, a magical roaming experience where giant luminous puppets come to life\, transforming Children's festival into a world of wonder and imagination. wering above the crowd\, these illuminated characters gracefully dance\, interact with visito and create unforgettable moments for audiences of all ages. Don't miss the chance of attending this parade with family and friends!
LOCATION:Ithra - Plaza
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-puppet-world.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-ajeeb-in-wonder-house@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T183000Z
SUMMARY:Ajeeb in Wonder House
DESCRIPTION:A story-led experience that follows Ajeeb as he visits a series of unusual homes\, each shaped by a different idea\, form\, or function. As the story unfolds\, children observe how each space reflects a way of living\, then shift into designing a home that suits Ajeeb himself. The activity combines storytelling with creative decision-making\, moving from observation to design.
LOCATION:Ithra - Ithra Tower - Level 4\, Show Tank
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-ajeeb-in-wonder-house.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-1-2-3-a-little-space-for-me@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T175000Z
SUMMARY:1\, 2\, 3\, A Little Space for Me
DESCRIPTION:Small spaces can hold big discoveries. Designed for children under three with their parents\, this environment is divided into three distinct zones: movement\, hands-on exploration\, and quiet play. Each area offers a different way to engage\, from active motion to focused interaction and calm building. The experience supports early development through movement\, touch\, and shared exploration.
LOCATION:Ithra - Plaza
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-1-2-3-a-little-space-for-me.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-1-2-3-lets-rhyme@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260822T083000Z
SUMMARY:1\, 2\, 3\, Let's Rhyme!
DESCRIPTION:Come sing along with us as we explore beloved nursery rhymes\, discover new ones\, and enjoy a wonderful storytelling experience. Connect with other families in a welcoming environment that promotes early childhood development and provides lots of entertainment. This session\, lasting for 30 minutes\, is ideal for children aged 0 to 3 years.
LOCATION:Ithra - Plaza
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-1-2-3-lets-rhyme.html
