BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-a-home-i-imagine@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T200000Z
SUMMARY:A Home I Imagine
DESCRIPTION:A home can begin as an idea and take shape in many forms. In this workshop\, imagination leads the design process. Through drawing\, building\, and assembling materials\, children develop their own vision of a home and translate it into a tangible model. Each creation results in a constructed home that reflects personal ideas and vision.
LOCATION:Ithra - Plaza
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-a-home-i-imagine.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-around-the-table@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T174500Z
SUMMARY:Around the Table
DESCRIPTION:An interactive activity where children explore how dining tables bring together different cultural practices. The program introduces a range of customs and habits from around the world\, showing how the way people gather\, sit\, and share meals can differ from one place to another. Through simple role-play\, children take part in everyday moments such as greeting others\, welcoming guests\, and spending time around a table.
LOCATION:Ithra - Children's Museum
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-around-the-table.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
