BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-built-by-nature@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T180000Z
SUMMARY:Built by Nature
DESCRIPTION:A bird&rsquo\;s nest\, a termite mound\, a shell\, each one is carefully built\, not by chance\, but by need. In this workshop\, children observe how living things design their homes\, then borrow these ideas to sketch and shape their own. Openings for air\, layers for protection\, and smart use of materials begin to appear in their designs. What starts in nature slowly turns into a built form.
LOCATION:Ithra - Energy Exhibit
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-built-by-nature.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-childrens-caf@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T200000Z
SUMMARY:Children's Café
DESCRIPTION:Step into the Children&rsquo\;s Caf&eacute\;\, a truly unique experience created just for your child! A space where little ones can enjoy their very own caf&eacute\; moment\, designed at their scale\, where they choose\, create and explore freely. From decorating their treats at the Art Toppings Station to relaxing in a cozy Reading Corner\, every detail is made to spark joy and imagination. It&rsquo\;s more than a caf&eacute\;... it&rsquo\;s a first-of-its-kind experience where children gain confidence in their creativity.
LOCATION:Ithra - Plaza
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-childrens-caf.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
