DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T190000Z
SUMMARY:Draw Your Story
DESCRIPTION:Drawing is one way to represent spaces\, ideas\, and everyday life to tell their stories through them. In this open drawing space\, children use different materials to create images related to their home\, activities\, and surroundings.
LOCATION:Ithra - Children's Museum
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-draw-your-story.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-hidden-home-bingo@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T180000Z
SUMMARY:Hidden Home Bingo
DESCRIPTION:A simple object at home might have a story that starts far beyond the room it sits in. In this fast-paced bingo challenge\, children move through clues and questions\, connecting everyday items to the materials behind them. As matches come together\, unexpected links appearو turning familiar spaces into something to decode and discover.
LOCATION:Ithra - Energy Exhibit
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-hidden-home-bingo.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-insightful-spaces@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T180000Z
SUMMARY:Insightful Spaces
DESCRIPTION:The way we experience a space is shaped by what we feel under our feet\, not just what we see. In this sensory journey\, children touch different carpeted surfaces\, noticing textures\, patterns\, and subtle changes in sensation. As they explore\, they begin to recognize how materials influence comfort\, sound and perception in everyday spaces.
LOCATION:Ithra - Energy Exhibit
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-insightful-spaces.html
END:VEVENT
