UID:event-lets-decorate@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T190000Z
SUMMARY:Let’s Decorate!
DESCRIPTION:Decorations change depending on the occasion\, the place\, and the people. At the Inspiration Spot\, children get inspired to make different styles to celebrate.
