DTSTART:20260710T140000Z
DTEND:20260731T190000Z
SUMMARY:Water Challenges
DESCRIPTION:Summer is here and you know what that means&hellip\; the water challenges are back! With all-new fun water-based challenges and activites\, and a special surprise to end the day with! A set of outdoor water-based activities where children move between water games that include pouring\, splashing\, and balancing tasks.
LOCATION:Ithra - Children's Oasis
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-water-challenges.html
