BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-the-house-of-ideas@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T143000Z
DTEND:20260725T170000Z
SUMMARY:The House of Ideas
DESCRIPTION:We begin with a simple question: Where do ideas live? Like us\, ideas need a place where they feel safe in a space that inspires them and gives them room to grow. In this experience\, we explore the House of Ideas: where we will see how a thought begins\, what nurtures it and how we can create spaces that allow it to flourish. By designing a pop-up house inside a notebook\, participants build a small\, personal world where their ideas can live and take shape. Through cutting\, folding and creating\, a quiet reflection unfolds: what helps our ideas grow\, and where do they truly belong
LOCATION:Ithra - Library - Level 2
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-the-house-of-ideas.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-house-of-wonder@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T123724Z
DTSTART:20260710T150000Z
DTEND:20260725T173000Z
SUMMARY:House of Wonder
DESCRIPTION:Wonder House is an interactive experience full of surprises and fun activities\, taking children on a journey of discovery\, imagination\, and excitement.
LOCATION:Ithra - Children's Museum
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-house-of-wonder.html
